  "body": "Stepping up to this striking two-storey residence, the quality of craftsmanship is immediately evident. Framed by distinctive schist columns, the secure keyless entry opens into a meticulously designed, approximately 260sqm home that effortlessly balances sophisticated style with the practical needs of modern family life. Situated in a vibrant new neighborhood just minutes from the heart of Orewa, this property offers a premium lifestyle close to local cafes, the beach, and schools. Nestled into it's own beautifully established garden and situated in an elevated and sunny position, it offers a serene bush outlook, peaceful setting and spectacular sunsets.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, an expansive open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area spans the entire depth of the lower level. This bright, fluid space captures a lovely natural outlook and opens directly onto the rear deck and level lawn, creating a seamless connection for indoor-outdoor entertaining. The kitchen itself is a chef's haven, equipped with premium Bosch double ovens, elegant marbled stone countertops, and a generous walk-in pantry that keeps appliances and essentials tucked away yet easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWith four bedrooms plus an office and a living room on each level, thoughtful spatial planning ensures everyone has room to breathe. On the ground floor, a versatile room bathed in morning light serves beautifully as a home office or guest bedroom, complete with its own slider to the deck. Upstairs, the layout transitions into a dedicated family hub. Three double bedrooms surround a second sunny lounge and a flexible nook ideal for a study zone or children's play space. Positioned for privacy, the master suite is a retreat featuring a large walk-in wardrobe and a spacious ensuite with twin vanities.\r\n\r\nThe home’s technical upgrades elevate daily comfort. All bathrooms are fully tiled, featuring generous frameless rain showers and underfloor heating to ward off the morning chill. A central air-conditioning and ducted heating system ensures the perfect climate year-round, while mains gas delivers efficient hot water.\r\n\r\nPracticality is woven into every corner, from the substantial under-stair and linen cupboards to the custom-fitted laundry units built into the carpeted garage. With Nukumea School just a five-minute stroll away and the sands of Orewa Beach only a short drive from your front door, this residence delivers an exceptional standard of living in a highly desirable coastal location.",
